WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.514
Open a new temporary chat and upload the chapter PDF.

00:00:04.514 --> 00:00:05.605
ChatGPT reads the uploaded chapter · accelerated.

00:00:05.605 --> 00:00:09.105
Write the prompt · fast typing.

00:00:09.105 --> 00:00:09.427
Send the shortcut as the second message.

00:00:09.427 --> 00:00:12.887
ChatGPT processes the prompt and builds the widget · accelerated.

00:00:12.887 --> 00:00:16.578
Inspect the generated widget before using its controls.

00:00:16.589 --> 00:00:22.560
Reveal the expected training explanation.

00:00:22.560 --> 00:00:26.925
Mark the parameter explanation activity complete.

00:00:26.925 --> 00:00:31.277
Mark the prompt-versus-training comparison complete.

00:00:31.277 --> 00:00:36.170
Move to the ordinary-inference step.

00:00:36.170 --> 00:00:39.451
Reveal the inference explanation.

00:00:39.451 --> 00:00:43.790
Complete the fixed-parameters activity.

00:00:43.790 --> 00:00:48.138
Complete the changed-input comparison.

00:00:48.138 --> 00:00:53.112
Open the context and retrieval step.

00:00:53.112 --> 00:00:59.145
Reveal the context and retrieval explanation.

00:00:59.145 --> 00:01:03.508
Mark the context activity complete.

00:01:03.508 --> 00:01:07.113
Complete all six activities and inspect 100% progress.

00:01:07.113 --> 00:01:13.069
Reveal the final recall answer.

00:01:13.069 --> 00:01:20.106
Reset checkmarks and explanations for a new study pass.
